  "vibe": "Near-black #10101c under hot red #ff4757, spark yellow #ffd23c and violet #7c5cff — notably, it glows, with glowing card borders, glowing stat numbers and a glowing button. Paytone One slams titles in from 2.2× scale with a −4° twist; Outfit does the body. The world is a live show: three shells rise on their own coloured tracer lines behind white heads, then burst into twelve-spoke stars with eight white embers that fall under gravity and fade, each on an independent loop, over fourteen twinkling stars and a black headland silhouette. Unlike its neighbours the sky stays on through montage, stats and CTA — the show never stops behind the copy. Fastest settle here (0.18) plus a spin move. Beats: a firing-script terminal, a split-flap T-minus, popping crowd pings, a card that flips on its axis.",
